  unitName: Aquamancer Kuhla
  unitId: 20483
  unitNumber: 684
  description: A sorceress from the Sama Kingdom. Innately gifted with magical powers,
    she was expected to become the greatest sorceress in the land once she received
    proper instruction. However, due to her silent and introverted personality, most
    priests refused to teach her and she was confined to the mountains. There she
    created her own magic research laboratory, where by chance she would find a seriously
    injured knight one day. Thanks to her devoted nursing, the knight was able to
    escape death. However, some days later a woman with a revelation from the gods
    appeared, and the knight left with her.
  summonDesc: A Summoner...?<br>Please, don't bother me with much...
  fusionDesc: Huh...?<br>Oh, forget it...
